version: 0.1.0

date-released: 2026-08-05

abstract: >
  CPC Validation is the reference validation framework for
  C-Parity Computing (CPC). The software independently computes
  continuation functions, generates physical circuit models,
  validates them using ngspice transient simulation, decodes
  the resulting physical responses, and compares them against
  mathematically computed reference continuations. The current
  release establishes the reproducible software-to-SPICE
  validation pipeline that serves as the engineering foundation
  for future compiled passive networks, Monte Carlo robustness
  analysis, hardware demonstrators, and coherent carrier systems.

